verikit adapts the verification method of pstack's create-formal-verification-skill,
maintain-formal-verification-skill and statechart skills (https://github.com/cursor/plugins,
harness/pstack). Ideas and a few phrases, notably "a check that you have never seen fail proves
nothing", come from those skills. pstack is distributed under the following license:

